    "poster_id": 11062,
    "post_rendered": "Prove that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2558b27902d084389a3b6502ada021afdc7b204c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c&gt;0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" > then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/4/a84165c8d8b938ff9d64c22dd4c2230394d6df97.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ \\frac{ab}{3a+4b+5c}+\\frac{bc}{3b+4c+5a}+\\frac{ca}{3c+4a+5b}\\le \\frac{a+b+c}{12}. \\]\"  width=\"447\" height=\"39\" ><br>\n<br>\n<i> Nikolai Nikolov</i>",
    "post_canonical": "Prove that if $a,b,c>0,$ then \\[ \\frac{ab}{3a+4b+5c}+\\frac{bc}{3b+4c+5a}+\\frac{ca}{3c+4a+5b}\\le \\frac{a+b+c}{12}. \\]\n\n[i] Nikolai Nikolov[/i]",
