    "topic_id": 89762,
    "poster_id": 11062,
    "post_rendered": "<b>Problem 6.</b> Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f939f7005de80d9837c6cb9b12317711b634b1fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p&gt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" > be prime. Find the number of the subsets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\"  width=\"14\" height=\"12\" > of the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/e/bce81090dff42cbf233d765b8c0ecf39b3b49e5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=\\{1,2,\\ldots,p-1\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"18\" > such that, the sum of the elements of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\"  width=\"14\" height=\"12\" > is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/6/9c6f23436a505304b2eb128a45ac703ff856cfd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"11\" ><br>\n<br>\n<i> Ivan Landgev</i>",
    "post_canonical": "[b]Problem 6.[/b] Let $p>2$ be prime. Find the number of the subsets $B$ of the set $A=\\{1,2,\\ldots,p-1\\}$ such that, the sum of the elements of $B$ is divisible by $p.$\r\n\r\n[i] Ivan Landgev[/i]",
