    "post_id": 524240,
    "post_type": "forum",
    "topic_id": 89769,
    "poster_id": 11062,
    "post_rendered": "Find all sequences of positive integers <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/8/9e82e7b6846e799d3d26bac1d4b4fa3ea51bfb88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{a_n\\}_{n=1}^{\\infty}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" >,</span> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/3/ee31835b7577ad64cba1a557d75cd477a024e030.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_4=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" > and<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/1/e313ee1268be34a99d8455bb6457ed398ca9f2f6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{a_1a_2a_3}+\\frac{1}{a_2a_3a_4}+\\cdots+\\frac{1}{a_na_{n+1}a_{n+2}}=\\frac{(n+3)a_n}{4a_{n+1}a_{n+2}}\\]\"  width=\"396\" height=\"42\" ><br>\nfor all natural <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/72287b09043ed45b372a517d764e12d07aff8071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" >.</span><br>\n<br>\n<i>Peter Boyvalenkov</i>",
    "post_canonical": "Find all sequences of positive integers $\\{a_n\\}_{n=1}^{\\infty}$, for which $a_4=4$ and\n\\[\\frac{1}{a_1a_2a_3}+\\frac{1}{a_2a_3a_4}+\\cdots+\\frac{1}{a_na_{n+1}a_{n+2}}=\\frac{(n+3)a_n}{4a_{n+1}a_{n+2}}\\]\nfor all natural $n \\geq 2$.\n\n[i]Peter Boyvalenkov[/i]",
