    "topic_id": 89764,
    "poster_id": 11062,
    "post_rendered": "<b> Problem 6.</b> Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/6/ca6b09d1fd6b64944831e5db761cce62f467c1a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\geq 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" > and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\"  width=\"10\" height=\"8\" > are given natural numbers, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\"  width=\"19\" height=\"12\" > is regular <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/639e85fa2f2bb450812e9c9de2067851e11a04d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" >-</span>gon. Find the number of the convex <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\"  width=\"15\" height=\"8\" >-</span>gons with vertices among the vertices of <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\"  width=\"19\" height=\"12\" >,</span> who have at least one acute angle.<br>\n<br>\n<i>Alexandar Ivanov</i>",
    "post_canonical": "[b] Problem 6.[/b] Let $m\\geq 5$ and $n$ are given natural numbers, and $M$ is regular $2n+1$-gon. Find the number of the convex $m$-gons with vertices among the vertices of $M$, who have at least one acute angle.\r\n\r\n[i]Alexandar Ivanov[/i]",
